Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:09.73,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,First, I would like to thank \Nall of you formally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:16.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Did Zentos, captain of the second \Nbattalion, really plan this attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:22.75,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes, and the person behind it all\N is my older brother, Carenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.90,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Your own brother would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.63,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,So it's a family quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.26,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:33.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It was really Zentos...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:36.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:37.25,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.77,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,After all, I heard it straight\Nfrom his lips last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.25,Flashback,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:51.40,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:56.90,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,At the very least, she won't wake up\N until tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:01.79,Flashback,CARENAS,0,0,0,,If we leave her in the woods, \Nshe'll be monster chow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:07.04,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,We'll tell everyone that she left \Nfor Sanes Village in spite of the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:11.56,Flashback,CARENAS,0,0,0,,And the princess who loves her\N people so much will be attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:15.02,Flashback,CARENAS,0,0,0,,on the way there, tragically meeting her end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:16.83,Flashback,CARENAS,0,0,0,,It's the perfect plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:24.22,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I knew my brother held such ambitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:29.44,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,but I thought he lacked \Nthe ability to act on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:32.86,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you're revealing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:34.46,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,It's all right, Ninos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:37.22,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I knew I recognized you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:39.32,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The girl with the flowers in Archen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.59,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,N-No, I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.69,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:46.21,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I had her change her appearance quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:50.08,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You caught my eye because you look\N like you'll be a babe one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So you set her up to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:57.02,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,It's best to be overt \Nwhen courting public favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:01:59.28,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,She just admitted to courting public favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.97,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Human politics are rather involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:06.09,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I never suspected Zentos whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:08.69,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,That was a fatal misestimation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:15.02,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Frankly, my brother is incompetent, \Nbut having Zentos on his side changes things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:18.70,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,The captain is both capable and well-liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.62,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Naturally, I've always been \Nwary of my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:31.71,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Whenever I go out, I insist that Kilren\N and the fifth battalion escort me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:33.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The fifth battalion...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:36.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I hear their company is entirely women.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:39.29,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes, but for their elegant grandeur,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:42.83,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,they're often summoned for ceremonies\Nin the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:47.22,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,So this time, Zentos was \Nassigned to escort me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:49.33,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:52.36,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I should've been suspicious\N that my brother came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.74,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I can't believe Zentos was \Ninvolved in the assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:02:59.74,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I just can't. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:02.70,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I can tell the princess isn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:07.75,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,There's no denying it...\NHe's our enemy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:13.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Since their monster assassination failed, \Nthey'll plot something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:17.78,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that Zentos \Nhas already planned ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:22.80,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He'll probably say that {\i1}we{\i0}\N attacked the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:25.29,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What? He's going to pin it on {\i1}us{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:26.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:30.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He'll paint us as heinous criminals \Nwho slaughtered her escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:31.26,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:34.10,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We can't go back and leave\N the princess behind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:39.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You were forthcoming with the details\Nto keep us from running, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:42.95,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Indeed. Now we're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.28,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Let's do what we can to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:50.69,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Naturally, I'll reward you if we make it\Nback to the royal capital safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.25,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.82,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We don't need money or status.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:58.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We ask only for honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:02.54,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,That's an unusual request.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:37.48,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,First, we have it in our favor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:41.05,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,that help will arrive if we buy enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:46.50,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Kilren's fifth battalion is scheduled \Nto arrive in Archen tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:50.65,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Once they learn I'm not there, \Nthey will come looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:53.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Won't they run into the second \Nbattalion when they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.87,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,With the fifth battalion,\Nour forces will be equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.87,0:06:00.01,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Any commotion would mean\N trouble for them, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:03.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So they're in a tough spot as well, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:07.30,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't we \Nhide out in Sanes Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Better that we don't.\NThey'll raze it to keep this quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.51,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yikes. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.52,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They'd do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:17.79,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,They've already killed a few royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.83,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They wouldn't think twice\Nabout a hundred villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:25.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's going to be dangerous, \Nbut we should turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There are tens of thousands\Nof people in Archen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:30.53,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They can't kill everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:33.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Plus, we'll meet up with the \Nfifth battalion sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:37.29,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,But we'll also run into our pursuers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:40.33,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan to slip past them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'll punch straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:44.80,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:53.80,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Zentos isn't with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:57.31,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The man who accompanied\N the princess in Archen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:07:00.46,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I've checked several times, \Nbut I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:05.82,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,That intelligent sword \Nis a rather helpful tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:09.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Her reconnaissance is going\Nto be our linchpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:12.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now that we know Zentos isn't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:16.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,we can plan accordingly and prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:18.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'd say our odds are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:21.81,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,So many magic stones...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:23.59,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Your Highness, take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.10,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Drink one right away if you get injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.82,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Top-class potions as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:36.72,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Just who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:40.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Aspiring heroes who happened\N to be passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:43.99,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:46.36,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Tell me what's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.00,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,There's no need for alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:52.86,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,My vice captain and men are \Npursuing the princess as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:55.02,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,And what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:58.12,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,You should be running off\Nto finish that broad too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:02.50,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,If the princess isn't in Archen \Nwhen the fifth battalion arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:06.33,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Captain Kilren will question you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:11.88,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,You'd have to handle that by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.05,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Listen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:18.02,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Now that you're in on my plan,\NI won't tolerate any screw-ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:20.27,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Do whatever it takes to finish Milena!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:22.27,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:25.52,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,I swear I will not let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:31.53,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,We're stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:35.96,Default,KNIGHT A,0,0,0,,I spotted the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.36,Default,KNIGHT A,0,0,0,,It should pass this way soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:39.54,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.24,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Aim for their legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:48.20,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,We just need to immobilize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:02.95,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Fi—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.83,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Don't break ranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:24.30,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,All troops, dismount!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We're charging ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:31.59,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.55,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Silpheed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:39.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Drop dead, losers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:44.75,Main - Top,THERON,0,0,0,,C'mon, c'mon, c'mon! Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:46.46,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,This is certainly... impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:56.06,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,See who's left standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.02,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,We'll give chase with whoever can still move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:09:59.07,Default,KNIGHT B,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:06.50,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Just look what you can do \Nwhen money's no object.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:10.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It was a pretty awful plan, \Nbut I'm glad it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:13.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In any case, we're safe for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.34,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I guess we were too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.02,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.35,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We'll have to abandon the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.87,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Your Highness, ladies. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:30.65,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Urza, can you use Windwalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:37.89,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Sure, but I'm not confident we'll \Nbe able to shake them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:39.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sildonia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:43.03,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed, our pursuers number about thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:45.68,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Good. That's way less than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:48.61,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They'll have a squad waiting \Nat the city entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:51.51,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We need to avoid getting pincered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:55.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Someone's got to stay back and slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.55,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,By themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Protecting the princess comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.45,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We're talking thirty royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.90,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Standing against them alone is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:05.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's all right. We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.27,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Kyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Theron can, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:13.42,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.52,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Huh? Sorry, I wasn't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:18.10,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's on you to stall the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.03,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.75,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Urza, cast Windwalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:26.89,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:28.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We don't have much time. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.67,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Windwalker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:40.05,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Wait! What do you expect me to do by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.80,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know it'll be hard, but good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.43,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,No, wait! You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:45.55,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Good luck, Theron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.90,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Wait! I said wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:54.95,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,They actually left me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:02.57,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.07,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:08.63,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I surrender! I don't want to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:11.19,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Please! Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:21.89,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.42,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It's all Kyle's fault!\NThe guy who just left me and ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:29.35,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,He dragged me into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:31.35,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,So, please, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.59,0:12:34.85,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.61,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I have tons of money. Look, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:40.96,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I found it in the labyrinth \Nof the Sungard Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.36,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I know where it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.64,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll show you there, so please spare—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:45.45,Default,KNIGHT A,0,0,0,,Vice Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:48.00,Default,KNIGHT C,0,0,0,,The princess isn't inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.49,Default,KNIGHT D,0,0,0,,They must've fled on the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.06,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,We'll go after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.00,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Wh-What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.52,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Dispose of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:01.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Please! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:04.76,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll do anything! Just don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.51,Default,VICE CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.69,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Kyle, are you serious\N about leaving Theron behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:14.29,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,They're certain to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:18.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, I would've preferred \Nthat no one had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:20.02,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You can't mean that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:21.35,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.35,0:13:23.59,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We hadn't told you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:24.78,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.05,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:29.04,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Theron is actually
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.40,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,way stronger than me or Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.50,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Sure enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:45.57,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Killing the big guy first\N is the way to go, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:09.33,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I feel light as a feather now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:12.53,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:38.06,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,All the horses are gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:41.71,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Pretty decent for an opener.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.45,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You know how he's always disappearing on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:49.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He's usually practicing with his sword alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:53.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He has zero aptitude for magic\Nand a questionable personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:58.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,but when it comes to skill with a blade,\N he's far better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.62,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He never slacks off in his training either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:04.61,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He wears all those Gravity accessories, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:08.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And he's ruthless in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:10.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'd never want to go up against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:12.84,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Then what of his frivolous attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Made you underestimate him, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Anyone who fights him, none the wiser...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.73,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,...Will be dead on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:21.60,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,So it's all an act to fool his enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:22.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:24.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's only half an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:26.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,More like 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.86,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Oh, really? I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.39,0:15:35.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Even Theron won't be able to hold \Nback against thirty royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:38.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I wish they didn't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:45.51,Main - Italics,THERON/ID,0,0,0,,Eight knights left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:48.98,Main - Italics,THERON/ID,0,0,0,,The royal guard sure is a determined bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:52.76,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What a massive pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:54.33,Default,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:16:00.35,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,My job is to slow you down, \Nnot kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:03.24,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Your horses are gone. We've killed some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:05.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,No way are you catching up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:09.28,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If you wanna run, you'd better hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.03,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If you hurry, some of you might survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.46,Default,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:15.42,Default,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:18.54,Default,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,No point in dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:21.74,Default,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.12,Default,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.86,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:59.30,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I was never going to let any of you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That was exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.96,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I managed to clean house over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:09.71,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You guys had better not mess this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:18.30,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Someone is interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:26.18,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Guard the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:28.52,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Let no one through until I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:29.61,Default,KNIGHTS,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:43.37,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:44.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:47.50,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,A single knight is heading your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:48.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Just one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.15,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed, just the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:00.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sildonia? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:04.13,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I was attacked with an Energy Bolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:05.52,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.27,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,But such power and accuracy at this range...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:10.02,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:11.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:14.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Princess Milena.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:16.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Hide here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:21.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If anything seems strange to you two,\N turn back and meet up with Theron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:22.52,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.13,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.79,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Zentos is coming, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:28.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.48,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,He is Zirgus's greatest knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.80,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Can you defeat him alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:39.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I wanted to avoid fighting him, \Nbut there's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Will you let me handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.10,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I've been wondering about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:50.05,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,You speak as though you know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:56.44,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Was it truly coincidence that you rescued us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:06.39,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,You're right. Now is not \Nthe time to discuss such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.21,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,My fate is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:16.34,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,May fortune favor you, Sir Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:21.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I swear I'll be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:49.87,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,You must be the one aiding the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:51.03,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.81,0:19:53.25,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Why have you come alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.57,0:19:55.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You must have other knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:20:00.38,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose anyone else \Nwho isn't a party to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:07.43,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,After all, I can resolve \Neverything here by killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:09.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:12.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm sure this will sound like a \Nstrange request to make now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:14.77,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,but would you consider surrendering?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:16.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I don't want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.40,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:21.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll even ask the princess to pardon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.65,0:20:23.78,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:25.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Also, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.67,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Why did you help try to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:33.32,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It wasn't for money or status, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:36.66,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,You don't need to know,\Nas you're about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:39.67,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:44.73,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,I will defeat you swiftly \Nand go after the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.41,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I really have no choice but to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:00.94,Default,KYLE & ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:02.33,Default,KYLE & ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.31,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Too shallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:37.06,Main - Italics,ZENTOS/ID,0,0,0,,My feint using illusion magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:41.07,Main - Italics,ZENTOS/ID,0,0,0,,No one's ever evaded it \Nthe first time they've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:46.18,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I know how you fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:58.86,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Because the one who taught me \Nhow to be a magic swordsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:02.62,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}Brothers in Arms
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:38.92,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "Brothers in Arms."
